comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-12T08:56:50.560Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete strict-read 2738-item all-status snapshot and keyword AND search package internal tier discovery found completed general tiering pm-kxci8x and active builtin helper routing pm-szdc but no focused arbitrary-package runtime-contract omission owner. This residual has a distinct dynamic registration boundary and remains open and unclaimed."
  "2026-09-12T09:22:42.310Z","harness:codex","Governance evidence: the mandatory defect gate rejected this newly recorded recurrence because its two-item lineage had no family seed. Register the completed surface-tier predecessor in declared-set-versus-hand-maintained-list: the reproduced failure consults a core-only identity list instead of the registered package contract. This selects existing static and smoke gates for both lineage members; registration does not claim the pending product fix is implemented."
